    {
      "id": "wrapper_on_queue",
      "kind": "source_observed",
      "text": "Per-buffer VP9 dims and compressed-layout metadata hang off the CAPTURE queue wrapper (struct avd_decoded_buffer), not the pixel memory.",
      "cite": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd.h",
        "lines": "79-84,104-123",
        "sha256": "283e311bc9108d734b2217e01fdcd950edd6f65a013b8e78a9c4a256a51a2739"
      },
      "cite_size": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-drv.c",
        "lines": "335",
        "sha256": "134264a2c7ed8779077ff3ee9e8e733c2cddb5cc1b6e3d4def673e40b87083ca"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wrapper_written_on_run",
      "kind": "source_observed",
      "text": "Each run copies ctx->comp into the destination wrapper and records vp9 width/height/bit_depth from the frame control.",
      "cite": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-v4l2.c",
        "lines": "968-969",
        "sha256": "2d1c3fc727d0427fcc0147c8f6f24367dfeb0851838bc093559a9c0630503c53"
      },
      "cite_dims": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-vp9.c",
        "lines": "514-520",
        "sha256": "065e2343426559569b44aa39d16a7ff2bd780e65003874093fddc17b9c07e1a4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "refs_from_wrapper",
      "kind": "source_observed",
      "text": "set_refs pushes each reference's wrapper vp9 dims, 14-bit xscale/yscale, and compressed address/offsets.",
      "cite": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-vp9.c",
        "lines": "197-234",
        "sha256": "065e2343426559569b44aa39d16a7ff2bd780e65003874093fddc17b9c07e1a4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "get_ref_fallback_dst",
      "kind": "source_observed",
      "text": "avd_get_ref_buf looks up a timestamp in the current CAPTURE queue and falls back to the destination buffer when the lookup misses.",
      "cite": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-drv.c",
        "lines": "95-111",
        "sha256": "134264a2c7ed8779077ff3ee9e8e733c2cddb5cc1b6e3d4def673e40b87083ca"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "start_on_output_streamon",
      "kind": "source_observed",
      "text": "OUTPUT STREAMON calls avd_vp9_start, which allocates the VP9 context, probability tables and scratch.",
      "cite": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-v4l2.c",
        "lines": "856-875",
        "sha256": "2d1c3fc727d0427fcc0147c8f6f24367dfeb0851838bc093559a9c0630503c53"
      },
      "cite_start": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-vp9.c",
        "lines": "982-1004",
        "sha256": "065e2343426559569b44aa39d16a7ff2bd780e65003874093fddc17b9c07e1a4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stop_on_output_streamoff",
      "kind": "source_observed",
      "text": "OUTPUT STREAMOFF calls avd_vp9_stop, which frees frame_context, last/cur, the segment map and all scratch.",
      "cite": {
        "file": "drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-v4l2.c",
        "lines": "899-911",
        "sha256": "2d1c3fc727d0427fcc0147c8f6f24367dfeb0851838bc093559a9c0630503c53"
      },
      "cite_stop": {
